feat(audit): Implement CR-P1 and CR-P2 measurement binaries
scale: ~824 lines across 14 files [L]

- **crates/vox-audit/src/bin/cr-p1.rs**: Added `cr-p1` binary to measure CR-P1 ("three apps deployed live"). It loads `contracts/marquee/manifest.v1.yaml`, resolves probe URLs for "real" apps (manifest, env var, or default localhost port), HTTP-GETs `/health` endpoints with a 5s timeout, and determines live status.
- **crates/vox-audit/src/bin/cr-p2.rs**: Added `cr-p2` binary to measure CR-P2 ("99.9% uptime over 7 days"). It supports two modes: probe-and-append (default) which probes app health and appends to `monitor.jsonl`, and compute-only (`--compute-only`) which rolls up existing logs. Both modes generate a 7-day uptime artifact.
